---
import type { Phase } from '@data/phases';
import { SITE } from '@data/site';
interface Props {phase:Phase}
const { phase } = Astro.props;
---
<section class="learn-section" id="stage-plan"><div class="learn-wrap"><div class="learn-heading"><div><div class="learn-eyebrow">Stage {phase.id} in practice</div><h2>A clear place to start.</h2><p>Give the work an owner, track what it depends on, and update your plan as you go.</p></div></div><div class="learn-grid two"><article class="learn-card"><span class="learn-tag">Start here</span><h3>The first useful action</h3><p>{phase.whatHappensFirst}</p></article><article class="learn-card"><span class="learn-tag">Timing</span><h3>Build a realistic schedule</h3><p>{phase.duration}</p><p>Confirm outside requirements and lead times before committing to dates.</p></article><article class="learn-card"><span class="learn-tag">Alongside it</span><h3>Work that can move together</h3><ul class="learn-list">{phase.whatCanHappenInParallel.map(item=><li>{item}</li>)}</ul></article><article class="learn-card"><span class="learn-tag">Watch for</span><h3>Common planning gaps</h3><ul class="learn-list">{phase.whatCommonlyDelays.map(item=><li>{item}</li>)}</ul></article></div><div class="learn-panel" style="margin-top:24px"><div class="learn-split"><div><div class="learn-eyebrow">Put it to work</div><h3>{phase.freeResource.label}</h3><a class="learn-link" href={phase.freeResource.href}>Open the free resource</a></div><div><div class="learn-eyebrow">When you want a hand</div><p>{phase.consultationTrigger}</p><a class="learn-link" href={SITE.scheduleUrl}>Talk with PPS</a></div></div></div></div></section>
